<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7754] WAL in LOG_ONLY mode doesn&apos;t execute fsync on checkpoint begin</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7754</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;On checkpoint begin method IgniteWriteAheadLogManager.fsync(WALPointer ptr) will be called, but it won&apos;t actually perform fsync because mode isn&apos;t FSYNC. It might lead to LFS corruption if OS or hardware failed until checkpoint had been finished.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13139462">IGNITE-7754</key>
